      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey so im feeling kinda weird lately. i feel like im drinking way more water than usual but i still feel thirsty all the time and im constantly running to the bathroom. also my breath smells kind of funny... almost like fruit or some kind of nail polish? is this just dehydration or something?",
